From: Guildbound Dev <dev@guildbound.local>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 02:38:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Patch 0348: Filter tabs on the recipe/enchant pickers

- New PickerModal 'tabs' prop + PickerOption 'tags' -- generic filter-tab support, opt-in per picker
- Blacksmith gear recipe picker: tabs by equipment slot (gearSlotTags/gearSlotTabs, derived from resultDefId)
- Weapon Enchanting and Armour Infusion enchant pickers: tabs by element
- Alchemist/Charms recipe picker: tabs by actual quest effect (success/gold/luck/insight/injury resist/peddler), read from real ConsumableDef.effect data, not guessed from names
- guild-idler-status.md updated with the patch 0348 entry
